    "html": "<section id=\"\" class=\"bg-cream relative w-full pt-(--padding-y) text-black md:pt-[calc(var(--padding-y)*1.5)]\"><div class=\"w-calc flex flex-col items-center gap-48\"><div class=\"flex w-full justify-center text-balance md:max-w-525\"><h2 class=\"w-calc type-z-34 md:type-z-80 text-balance\"><span class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-center\"><span><span class=\"no-js:opacity-100! inline-flex items-center\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">Safety</span><span> </span></span><span><span class=\"no-js:opacity-100! inline-flex items-center\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">is</span><span> </span></span><span><span class=\"no-js:opacity-100! inline-flex items-center\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">core</span><span> </span></span><span><span class=\"no-js:opacity-100! inline-flex items-center\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">to</span><span> </span></span><span><span class=\"no-js:opacity-100! inline-flex items-center\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">our</span><span> </span></span><span><span class=\"no-js:opacity-100! inline-flex items-center\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">DNA.</span><span></span></span></span></span></h2></div><div class=\"whitespace-pre-line type-z-24 mx-auto max-w-670 text-center text-current/50\"><span>The future of autonomous transportation requires us to build on established safety </span><span>constructs and leverage&nbsp;</span><span>transformative technologies that allow us to do more than what\u2019s previously been possible.</span></div></div><div class=\"w-calc relative flex gap-180 md:mt-102 md:pt-100 max-md:w-full max-md:flex-col-reverse max-md:gap-48 max-md:pt-48\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-full -translate-x-1/2 overflow-clip pb-[50svh] max-md:hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center h-full flex-col justify-center\" style=\"transform:translateY(-100%)\"><div class=\"bg-pink h-full w-2 translate-y-12\"></div><div class=\"bg-pink size-12 rounded-full -mb-full translate-y-12\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full gap-24 max-md:flex-col max-md:overflow-x-clip md:gap-90\"><div class=\"w-full pr-12 md:hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center\" style=\"transform:translateX(-100%)\"><div class=\"bg-pink h-2 w-full\"></div><div class=\"bg-pink size-12 rounded-full -ml-full absolute right-0\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex-center top-0 md:sticky md:h-svh\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4 md:gap-12\" style=\"transform: none;\"><div class=\"relative grid w-30 overflow-clip md:w-48\"><p class=\"area type-z-24 md:type-z-40\" style=\"transform:none\">0<!-- -->0</p></div><p class=\"type-s-12 text-current/50\">/<!-- -->3</p></div></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex gap-24 max-md:overflow-scroll max-md:pb-60 md:flex-col md:gap-90\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none flex w-full items-center md:min-h-[100svh] max-md:w-full max-md:shrink-0 max-md:px-40\" style=\"transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-fit flex-col gap-24 max-md:opacity-100!\" style=\"opacity: 0.15;\"><h2 class=\"type-z-40 pointer-events-auto max-w-290 max-md:text-center\">Safety from the inside out.</h2><div class=\"whitespace-pre-line type-s-15 prose-links pointer-events-auto text-current/50 max-md:text-center\"><span>Our governance structure ensures that every decision prioritizes safety. Every team member, from engineers to operators, has the authority to raise a concern. Our publicly shared </span><a href=\"https://research-assets.waabi.ai/Waabi%20VSSA/231030%20StAn%20Waabi%20Voluntary%20Safety%20Self-Assessment%2A.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>VSSA</span></a><span> openly documents our strategy\u2014</span><span>giving everyone access to the approaches that guide our operations.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none flex w-full items-center md:min-h-[100svh] max-md:w-full max-md:shrink-0 max-md:px-40 md:mt-[-50svh]\" style=\"transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-fit flex-col gap-24 max-md:opacity-100!\" style=\"opacity:0.15\"><h2 class=\"type-z-40 pointer-events-auto max-w-290 max-md:text-center\">Built different. Built safer.</h2><div class=\"whitespace-pre-line type-s-15 prose-links pointer-events-auto text-current/50 max-md:text-center\">Our simulation-first approach tests thousands of safety-critical scenarios before they ever happen on public roads, making every mile driven more valuable and safe.</div></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none flex w-full items-center md:min-h-[100svh] max-md:w-full max-md:shrink-0 max-md:px-40 md:mt-[-50svh]\" style=\"transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-fit flex-col gap-24 max-md:opacity-100!\" style=\"opacity:0.15\"><h2 class=\"type-z-40 pointer-events-auto max-w-290 max-md:text-center\">Pioneering new standards.</h2><div class=\"whitespace-pre-line type-s-15 prose-links pointer-events-auto text-current/50 max-md:text-center\"><span>We rigorously adhere to many established industry best practices while pioneering new methodologies where existing standards fall short. </span>Our work in simulation realism and Mixed Reality Testing is establishing benchmarks for the entire industry.</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex-center w-full max-md:px-40 md:sticky md:top-0 md:h-svh md:py-100\"><div class=\"relative aspect-square w-full md:aspect-[525/600]\"><div class=\"relative grid h-full w-full overflow-clip rounded-[1.2rem] bg-black\" style=\"transform: none;\"></div></div></div></div></section>",
